1
00:00:00,907 --> 00:00:03,777
(Howard:)No idea.
Ask him.

2
00:00:03,776 --> 00:00:05,476
(Raj:)12 minutes.

3
00:00:05,478 --> 00:00:07,708
(Midwife:)12 minutes?
Why are you here?

4
00:00:07,713 --> 00:00:10,113
(Stuart:)Aren't we supposed to get here
an hour and a half early?

5
00:00:10,116 --> 00:00:13,246
(Midwife:)This is a hospital,
not the airport.

6
00:00:14,187 --> 00:00:16,387
(Bernadette:)I'm sorry.
It's our first time.

7
00:00:16,389 --> 00:00:17,519
(Midwife:)It's okay.

8
00:00:17,523 --> 00:00:19,723
(Midwife:)This little one will be
here before you know it.

9
00:00:19,725 --> 00:00:21,595
(Midwife:)Do we know what
we're having?

10
00:00:21,594 --> 00:00:23,164
(Howard:)No, we're keeping it
a surprise.

11
00:00:23,162 --> 00:00:25,262
(Midwife:)Old school. Nice.

12
00:00:25,264 --> 00:00:28,264
Not that old school.
He knows.

13
00:00:28,267 --> 00:00:32,137
(Raj:)You see, I was
at the doctor's office,

14
00:00:32,138 --> 00:00:35,308
(Raj:)the folder was right there,
so I took a peek.

15
00:00:35,308 --> 00:00:37,538
(Howard:)And talking like this

16
00:00:37,543 --> 00:00:40,683
(Howard:)doesn't make it less creepy.

17
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:41,950
(Midwife:)Sweetheart, go home.

18
00:00:41,948 --> 00:00:43,418
(Midwife:)Come back when
the contractions

19
00:00:43,416 --> 00:00:45,116
(Midwife:)are five minutes
apart for an hour.

20
00:00:45,117 --> 00:00:46,317
(Bernadette:)I'm sorry.

21
00:00:46,319 --> 00:00:47,549
(Raj:)That's ambiguous.

22
00:00:47,553 --> 00:00:49,983
(Raj:)Is it five minutes apart
starting at the top of the hour,

23
00:00:49,989 --> 00:00:51,289
(Raj:)or five minutes apart starting

24
00:00:51,290 --> 00:00:55,390
(Raj:)with the first contraction, so
essentially, like, 65 minutes?

25
00:00:55,394 --> 00:00:58,334
(Midwife:)I'm just throwing
this out there,

26
00:00:58,331 --> 00:01:04,021
(Midwife:)but home births are
very popular these days.

